# Copy to app/.env and paste your own key. app/.env is gitignored.
#
#   cd app && cp .env.example .env
#   then paste the key after the = below, and run:
#   node scripts/check-free.mjs
#
# Get a key at openrouter.ai. You must be 13+, and if you are under 18 you need
# a parent or guardian's permission. Do NOT add a payment method: an account
# with no card on it cannot be charged, which is the strongest safeguard there
# is, and the app is built to only ever use :free models anyway.
#
# Free tier: 20 requests/minute, 50/day.
#
# NOTE: EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the JS bundle and ARE extractable
# from a shipped build. Fine for a demo key on an account with no card. For a
# public release, put a proxy in front and keep the key on the server.
#
# The app refuses to run any model whose id does not end in :free.
#
# Model choice matters a lot. Measured on the same statute: lfm-2.5-2.6b takes
# about 5 seconds, nemotron-3.5-lightning took 102. Both were accurate.
EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_KEY=
EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_MODEL=liquid/lfm-2.5-2.6b:free
